# Trivy exception file.
#
# Keep this file empty until a finding has been reviewed.
# Never ignore a finding only to make the pipeline green.
#
# For every future exception:
# - include only the exact CVE/check/secret rule ID;
# - document the business reason in the pull request;
# - assign an owner and an expiry date in the pull request;
# - remove the exception as soon as the dependency or configuration is fixed.
